Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:37.73,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正楷体_GBK\an8\fad(300,300)\shad0\bord4\fs100\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\4c&H000000&\4a&H38&\pos(915.333,729.333)}武神祭剑术大会参赛指南
